      "content": "wait what lol. anyway, i just checked the app and there are like no flights left on my airline for tonight. i'm thinking about looking at other airlines or maybe a different hub like dubai or frankfurt. which one would actually save me time? i dont want to be stuck in another airport for 12 hours.",
